    "name": "Refined Soul, Thorn Catalyst",
    "description": "Passively grants 15 Range, 5 Stability, and 5 Airborne Effectiveness.\nKills or collecting Remnants grants 'Refined Soul' for 7 seconds. Additional kills or Remnants can extend this timer up to 11 seconds.\nRefined Soul grants 10 Range, 15 Handling, and 50 Mobility.",
